{
  "title": "Kinesis Data Streams · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "지속적으로 들어오는 데이터를 수집하고 여러 처리 작업에서 사용합니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Kinesis Data Streams</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#guide-1\">데이터를 스트림으로 처리하기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#guide-2\">용량과 전달 서비스 선택</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#notes\">각주</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>통합</span><span>30 / 62</span></div><h1>Kinesis Data Streams</h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>Kinesis Data Streams는 <strong>연속해서 들어오는 데이터를 스트림으로 수집하는 서비스</strong>입니다. 클릭 기록, 센서 값, 애플리케이션 이벤트처럼 끊임없이 생성되는 데이터를 빠르게 받아 처리할 때 사용합니다.</p><p>수집한 데이터는 보관 기간 동안 여러 소비자가 읽거나 다시 읽을 수 있습니다. 한 작업자가 처리 후 삭제하는 작업 큐와는 사용 방식이 다릅니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"streams-shards-and-records\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"partition-keys-and-ordering\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"provisioned-mode\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"on-demand-standard\"></span><h2>데이터를 스트림으로 처리하기</h2><p>생산자가 레코드를 보내면 파티션 키<sup><a aria-label=\"각주 1\" class=\"concept-note-ref\" href=\"#note-1\" id=\"note-ref-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">[1]</a></sup>를 기준으로 스트림의 처리 단위인 샤드에 나뉩니다. 소비자는 자신의 읽기 위치를 관리하며 필요한 데이터를 처리합니다.</p><p>Lambda나 스트림 처리 애플리케이션으로 집계와 이상 탐지를 수행할 수 있습니다. 소비자별 진행 상황과 지연을 관찰해 데이터를 제때 처리하는지 확인합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"on-demand-advantage\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"shared-throughput-and-enhanced-fan-out\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"kinesis-client-library-and-checkpoints\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"retention-and-replay\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"amazon-data-firehose-and-managed-service-for-apache-flink\"></span><h2>용량과 전달 서비스 선택</h2><p>온디맨드 또는 프로비저닝 용량을 선택하고 데이터량과 키 분포를 고려합니다. 특정 키에 데이터가 몰리면 해당 처리 단위의 부하가 커질 수 있습니다.</p><p>S3 같은 목적지에 데이터를 지속적으로 전달하는 관리형 적재가 주목적이라면 Amazon Data Firehose를 검토합니다. 스트림을 읽어 사용자 지정 처리하는 것과 목적지에 적재하는 역할을 구분합니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>실시간 데이터 처리</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ol class=\"concept-flow\"><li><strong>생산자</strong><span>클릭·센서·로그 전송</span></li><li><strong>Data Streams</strong><span>데이터 보관·순서 관리</span></li><li><strong>소비자들</strong><span>집계·분석·다시 읽기</span></li></ol><p class=\"diagram-note\">각 소비자는 자신의 목적과 읽기 위치에 따라 같은 스트림을 사용할 수 있습니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>사용자 클릭을 스트림에 넣고 한 소비자는 실시간 인기 상품을 집계하며 다른 소비자는 이상 행동을 탐지합니다.</p></section><section class=\"concept-notes\" id=\"notes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"><h2>각주</h2><ol><li id=\"note-1\"><strong>파티션 키</strong> — 레코드가 어느 샤드로 전달될지 결정하는 데 사용하는 값입니다. 분포와 동일 키의 처리 순서를 고려해 선택합니다. <a aria-label=\"각주 1의 본문으로 돌아가기\" class=\"concept-note-back\" href=\"#note-ref-1\">↩</a></li></ol></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/streams/latest/dev/introduction.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What is Amazon Kinesis Data Streams? ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-2\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/streams/latest/dev/how-do-i-size-a-stream.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Choose the right mode to stream in ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q075/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q075\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q075\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q075</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q075/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Several analytics consumers must independently read real-time click records and replay them within a retention period. Which service should be considered?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q075\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">NAT Gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q075\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An AMI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q075\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon Kinesis Data Streams</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q075\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A one-time Elastic IP address</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/\">Kinesis</a> 스트림은 레코드와 소비자별 읽기 위치, 보존 기간 내 재읽기를 제공한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kinesis/\">Kinesis Data Streams</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q073\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q073\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q073</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q073/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">The same event must reach separate SQS queues for an email service and an analytics service. Which pattern is appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q073\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A single EBS Multi-Attach volume</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q073\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Subscribe both SQS queues to an SNS topic</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q073\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Duplicate one ENI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q073\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Connect two workers to a single SQS queue only</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a>→여러 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a> 큐가 각 소비자 그룹에 사본을 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">팬아웃</a>한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0,1\" data-question=\"Q092\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q092\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q092</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q092/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An order event must be processed independently by several services. Which TWO components are central to the design?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q092\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A separate SQS queue for each consumer service</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q092\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Publish the event to an SNS topic</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q092\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">All workers share the same ENI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q092\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Move one EBS volume between AZs</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q092\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"4\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">Remove every network ACL</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">팬아웃</a>과 소비자별 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a> 큐를 조합한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q071\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q071\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q071</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q071/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An order API hands work to asynchronous workers and must retry tasks when a worker fails. Which service should buffer the work?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q071\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An internet gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q071\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q071\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon SQS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q071\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a>로 생산자와 소비자를 분리하고 메시지 삭제·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#visibility-timeout\">visibility timeout</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/#dead-letter-queues-and-redrive\">DLQ</a>를 설계한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/\">API Gateway</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q072\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q072\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q072</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q072/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A worker receives an SQS message but fails before deleting it. What generally happens?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q072\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">The message disappears permanently</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q072\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A new message is always inserted at the back of the queue</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q072\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">The message automatically moves to an SNS topic</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q072\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">The message can be received again after the visibility timeout</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · 메시지는 삭제 전까지 큐에 남고 숨김 시간이 끝나면 다시 보일 수 있다. 표준 큐에서는 순서를 가정하지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">이전 용어 <b>Internet Gateway</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/\">다음 용어 <b>KMS</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
